TY  - JOUR
TI  - Topical Tranexamic Acid Applied to the Uterine Incision Versus Placebo at Caesarean Birth: The SHORELINE Trial
AU  - Specimen, Dara
AU  - Example, Ada
AB  - PURPOSE: To assess tranexamic acid applied topically to the uterine incision at caesarean birth. METHODS: In this randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled phase 2 trial, women having a caesarean birth received topical tranexamic acid or placebo on the uterine incision. RESULTS: Blood loss was lower with topical tranexamic acid.
